{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Who redeems</b> — How many times was he ready to die, and in his illness he thought he would die." "<b>And the meaning of המעטרכי</b> — that He guided him in his illness gently, with kindness and compassion."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 103, :notes {0 "Resolved הגואל as the lemma from Psalms 103:4.", 1 "המעטרכי left in Hebrew as Ibn Ezra quotes it; the form is obscure, possibly corrupt."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:58.000881194Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}